sequenceDiagram
    participant ParentAgent as all_model_agent
    participant LogicalAgent as logical_modeller_agent
    participant SearchTools as Search Tools
    actor User

    ParentAgent->>LogicalAgent: 1. "Create Logical Data Model"
    activate LogicalAgent

    note over LogicalAgent, SearchTools: 2. Agent uses context variables (e.g., conceptual_data_model) and calls all search tools in parallel to gather information.

    LogicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3a. call_blueprint_search(...)
    LogicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3b. call_ddl_search(...)
    LogicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3c. call_google_search(...)
    LogicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3d. call_user_responses_search(...)
    LogicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3e. call_user_rule_search(...)
    LogicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3f. call_bq_best_prac_search(...)
    LogicalAgent->>SearchTools: 3g. extract_from_sql_queries(...)
    
    activate SearchTools
    SearchTools-->>LogicalAgent: 4. Return search results
    deactivate SearchTools
    
    note right of LogicalAgent: 5. Agent synthesizes all inputs (context variables, search results) and generates the Logical Model artifact.

    LogicalAgent-->>User: 6. "Here is the generated Logical Data Model. Please review."
    
    LogicalAgent->>LogicalAgent: 7. Calls 'save_output' tool to save the generated artifact to a file (e.g., logical_data_model.csv).
    
    alt User provides feedback by uploading a file
        User->>LogicalAgent: 8a. Uploads modified file.
        LogicalAgent->>LogicalAgent: 9a. Calls 'read_input' tool to process the uploaded file as the new source of truth.
    else User provides verbal go-ahead
        User->>LogicalAgent: 8b. "Looks good, proceed."
    end

    LogicalAgent-->>ParentAgent: 10. Returns final result and completion status.
    deactivate LogicalAgent
